From: Codex local A376B compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Port existing platform-key integration to AZH4 certificate collection

Reason: remaining2-modules-preflight.txt:31-46 rejects old InstallPackageHelper/ScanPackageUtils contexts; further preflight shows actual register and certificate-collection refactoring. Add an A376B-only parallel diff derived from the existing fork implementation. Preserve configured certificate equality and stock platform identity; do not globally bypass signature checks. Initialize the custom certificate field at a safe constructor point, retain ScanPackageUtils/PackageManagerServiceUtils helpers, adapt both applyPolicy calls to actual v15 receiver/dead scratch v3, and normalize selected cached/fresh SigningDetails immediately after collectCertificatesLI through a void instance helper (no parent register changes). Keep other donors on original diff.
Files: unica/patches/signature/customize.sh; unica/patches/signature/services.jar/0002-A376B-Allow-custom-platform-signature.patch.
Verification: exact donor diff preflight, actual signature module including preserve_platform_identity.py PASS; no old four-argument call remains. Services assembly/compiled certificate-path checks, clean full build and runtime PackageManager logs remain required. Revert0055.

---
--- a/unica/patches/signature/customize.sh
+++ b/unica/patches/signature/customize.sh
@@ -5,7 +5,11 @@
     ABORT "File not found: security/${CERT_PREFIX}_platform.x509.pem"
 fi
 
-APPLY_PATCH "system" "system/framework/services.jar" "$MODPATH/services.jar/0001-Allow-custom-platform-signature.patch"
+if [ "${ROM_SOURCE_CONFIG:-}" = "essi_a376b_android16" ]; then
+    APPLY_PATCH "system" "system/framework/services.jar" "$MODPATH/services.jar/0002-A376B-Allow-custom-platform-signature.patch"
+else
+    APPLY_PATCH "system" "system/framework/services.jar" "$MODPATH/services.jar/0001-Allow-custom-platform-signature.patch"
+fi
 
 CERT_SIGNATURE="$(sed "/CERTIFICATE/d" "$SRC_DIR/security/${CERT_PREFIX}_platform.x509.pem" | tr -d "\n" | base64 -d | xxd -p -c 0)"
 SMALI_PATCH "system" "system/framework/services.jar" \
